Rowan is a small, fine-boned man with a blue and green gem set into his throat. He is an enemy of [[Org/Althane/The Weft|the Weft]], who killed him, and he has come back. What returns wears his shape only at first: it becomes a mass of mouths, eyes and arms, and it blames the Weft for his death.
